                    },
                    "message": "But ACTIVE_HIGH is of type int; we have a variable to check the polarity.\nauto flags = (polarity == gpiod::line::ACTIVE_HIGH)\n                  ? 0\n                  : gpiod::line_request::FLAG_ACTIVE_LOW;"
                },
